### CampusQuest Previous Year Questions (PYQs) Tests

### 1. Get All PYQs
GET http://localhost:5000/pyqs

### 2. Get PYQs filtered by Subject and Year
GET http://localhost:5000/pyqs?subjectId=1&year=2024

### 3. Get Single PYQ by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/pyqs/1

### 4. Create PYQ (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:5000/pyqs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject_id": 1,
    "regulation": "2021",
    "year": 2023,
    "semester": 5,
    "exam_type": "Supplementary",
    "title": "DBMS University Supplementary Exam 2023",
    "file_url": "/uploads/pyqs/dbms_2023_supp.pdf"
}
